### FRAMING INSTRUCTIONS (Both Clothing & Footwear)

**PRODUCT ONLY (No Human Model)** — Footwear only:
```
PRODUCT-ONLY shot. NO human model. The image shows ONLY the footwear product against the background.
The shoe(s) should be the SOLE subject, well-lit, full product visible.
Professional studio-quality composition.
```

**FEET CLOSE-UP** — Footwear only:
```
Extreme close-up showing ONLY feet and ankles wearing the footwear.
Frame: mid-calf/ankle down to ground/sole.
Detail shot focused on how footwear looks when worn — fit, ground interaction, product details at close range.
```

**FULL BODY (Head to Toe):**
```
COMPLETE model from head to toe including feet/footwear.
Entire garment length visible. Breathing room above head and below feet. No body part cropped.
```

**THREE-QUARTER BODY (Head to Below Knee):**
```
Head to just below the knees (~75% of body).
Lower calves and feet NOT visible. Full garment length for tops, dresses, knee drape.
```

**MID-THIGH / COWBOY SHOT:**
```
Head to mid-thigh level. Classic "cowboy shot". Full upper body, hip area.
Full length of tops/jackets, waistband/upper portion of bottoms.
```

**WAIST-UP:**
```
Head to waist/hip area. UPPER BODY only. Medium close-up for necklines, collars, sleeves, bust fit,
upper garment construction, prints, fabric texture. Lower body below waist NOT visible.
```

**BUST-UP / CLOSE-UP:**
```
Upper chest, neck, and head area. Fine details: neckline construction, collar shape, fabric texture,
stitching quality, button/closure detail, print clarity, embellishment craftsmanship.
```

**LOWER BODY (Hip to Feet):**
```
ONLY lower body from hip/waist down to feet. Upper body NOT visible.
Footwear: FOOTWEAR is the HERO — prominently visible, detailed, with complementary clothing above.
Clothing: LOWER BODY GARMENT is hero — waistband, belt loops, pockets, fly, thigh fit, knee break, taper, hemline.
```

**KNEE-DOWN:**
```
ONLY from knee down to feet.
Footwear: FOOTWEAR is absolute HERO — extreme detail, pant/sock interaction, construction, material, branding.
Clothing: Extreme lower-body detail — pant leg taper, hem/cuff, ankle fit, pant break on shoes, cropped length.
Upper body and thighs NOT visible.
```

