### GARMENT TYPE EMPHASIS

**TOPWEAR:**
```
Hero garment is a TOP. MAXIMUM detail to: neckline, sleeve length + construction, front/back closure,
shoulder seam, body/torso fit, fabric texture, print/pattern placement, hemline.
Bottomwear is secondary — describe briefly.
```

**BOTTOMWEAR:**
```
Hero garment is a BOTTOM. MAXIMUM detail to: waistband style, rise height, front fly/closure,
pocket style + placement, belt loops, thigh fit, knee area, leg silhouette, hemline/cuff,
fabric texture, seam construction.
Topwear is secondary — describe briefly.
```

**ONEPIECE:**
```
Hero garment is ONE PIECE. MAXIMUM detail to: neckline, bodice fit, waistline treatment,
skirt/leg portion, overall length, sleeve details, back detail, fabric flow,
pattern placement across full garment, upper-to-lower transition.
Both upper and lower portions described with equal precision.
```

**FOOTWEAR (product type emphasis includes BRAND-BLIND approach):**
```
Hero product is FOOTWEAR. MAXIMUM detail to:
UPPER, TOE, HEEL, SOLE/OUTSOLE, MIDSOLE, CLOSURE, COLLAR/TOPLINE, TONGUE, INSOLE,
COLORWAY, STITCHING, HARDWARE.

═══ BRANDING & LOGO PRESERVATION — BRAND-BLIND APPROACH (MOST CRITICAL) ═══
★★★ DO NOT IDENTIFY THE BRAND BY NAME ★★★

Describe every branding element PURELY as abstract visual shapes and graphics.
NEVER name the brand (no "Nike Swoosh", "Adidas Stripes", "Puma Cat").

For EACH branding element:
1. VISUAL SHAPE: Exact geometric form ("curved checkmark-shaped graphic", "three parallel diagonal stripes")
2. RENDERING STYLE: Embossed, debossed, printed, stitched, reflective, metallic, perforated, woven
3. COLOR(S): Exact color of the mark
4. SIZE: Relative to shoe surface
5. PLACEMENT: Exact position — which surface and precise location
6. TEXT/WORDMARKS: Exact letterforms, font style, spacing, color — as visual text, not brand
7. MULTIPLE MARKS: Each instance separately with full detail

WHY BRAND-BLIND: Image generator substitutes wrong logo variants from world knowledge if it recognizes a brand.
THE IMAGE GENERATOR MUST REPRODUCE ALL VISUAL MARKS WITH 100% FIDELITY — ZERO changes to anything.
```

