## FUNCTION 2: `generateVTONImage()`

### Clothing Architecture (Text-First)
```
Content Parts Order:
1. TEXT: Generated prompt + "garment must match provided reference images EXACTLY" +
   model reference instruction if applicable
2. IMAGE: Model reference photo (if provided, not product-only)
3. IMAGES: Garment reference images
4. IMAGES: Complementary garment images
5. IMAGES: Accessory reference images (only those with uploaded images)
```

### Footwear Architecture (IMAGES-FIRST)
The key insight: less text = model pays more attention to images.

```
Content Parts Order:
1. IMAGES: Footwear reference images FIRST
2. IMAGE: Model reference (if on-model shot)
3. IMAGES: Complementary/accessory images
4. TEXT: Generated prompt + enforcement instruction:
   "Keep the shoes exactly the same as in the reference images above.
   Preserve the original colors, patterns, textures, materials, shape, logos, and branding
   exactly as they appear — do not change, replace, or reinterpret any detail of the footwear.
   Do not use your knowledge of any brand to modify the logos or branding —
   copy only what is visible in the reference photos."
   + Model instruction if on-model
   + Product-only instruction if no model
```

### API Config
```typescript
{
  model: "gemini-3-pro-image-preview",
  contents: contents,
  config: {
    responseModalities: ["TEXT", "IMAGE"],
